：调试射线、范围检测逻辑是否正常，比如子弹打不中敌人，是因为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Raycast"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 没命中还是方向错了的问题"}]},{"ID":"20250926141239-yooe3nm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926141239-yooe3nm","updated":"20250926141255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250926141255-bk35wh2.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250926145322-xnxg35y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926145322-xnxg35y","updated":"20250926145344"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"调整了上边页签的数值后，点击右侧的 Reset 即可重置参数"}]},{"ID":"20250926140457-dh6d9f6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926140457-dh6d9f6","updated":"20250926141408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"打开 Physics Debugger 后，Scene 中会出现 Physics Debug 的小窗口，它是 Scene 窗口里 Physics Debugger 的浮动工具栏\n它提供了几个快速开关，主要用于控制物理调试可视化的显示内容"}]},{"ID":"20250926141411-l2j5d7c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250926141411-l2j5d7c","updated":"20250926141435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250926141435-82wm4s8.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250926140600-zd07yqt","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250926140600-zd07yqt","updated":"20250926142240"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250926140612-0400vfv","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250926140612-0400vfv","updated":"20250926140612"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250926140612-